msgid "A RESOURCE is a REVISION of an earlier resource (E.D. 2026-09-30, «la revisione della risorsa»): the same thing, with one file replaced — a corrected texture. The newer resource is the source, the older the target. The older one stays as it was and citable; the revision is a new ResourceNode with the same fields and the same files but the replaced one, and the new file declares dtc\\_derived\\_from the old file. What pointed at the old resource (a Representation Model, a property, a document) is NOT moved by the edge nor by replace\\_file: whoever calls decides. The chain is read with s3dgraphy.api.revisions\\_of / current\\_revision. Same name as ProjectVersion.was\\_revision\\_of in the em.json container, which says the same thing of a document version."
msgstr ""

